next.text:
2.5.1 The following categories of members can use
the “NBLS” designation after their name:
(a) Land surveyor members;
(b) Life members;
(c) Associate members provided they were once a
land surveyor member;
(d) Honorary members provided they were once a
land surveyor member; and
(e) Retired members.
Revised January 2019

